  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jeyranchel clearance project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The hazard from UXO and mines in the Jeyranchel area presents a serious humanitarian, socio-economic and environmental threat to the local population. The aim of this project is to clear UXO and mines from 19 Sq Km of the Western section of the former Soviet Army training area of Jeyranchel, NW Azerbaijan over 28 months. The former Soviet Army military test and training area, known as Jeyranchel, covers an area of approximately 64 Sq Km against the Azerbaijan/Georgia border.</narrative>
  </description>
